   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Within and in",
     "texto": [
      "**Через** (within) with the accusative indicates when something will happen: **через неделю** («within a week»), **через год** («within a year»). **За** (in, within a period) with the accusative indicates the time something takes: **за месяц** («in a month»), **за час** («in an hour»).",
      "Difference: **Я приеду через неделю** = I will arrive within a week. **Я выучу русский за год** = I will learn Russian in a year."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Until, after and about",
     "texto": [
      "**До** (until, before), **после** (after) and **около** (about) take the genitive: **до понедельника** («until Monday»), **после работы** («after work»), **около месяца** («about a month»).",
      "**В течение** (during) also takes the genitive: **в течение дня** («during the day»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
